# Full Docs Coverage After Changes

- For every code/content change, evaluate documentation impact before finishing.
- Treat all Markdown docs as in-scope, including `README.md`, `docs/**/*.md`, and release notes files.
- Keep code + docs in the same change so published docs never lag implementation.
- If no doc edits are required, explicitly state why docs were unaffected.
- Do not leave stale commands, outdated defaults, broken links, or mismatched terminology across code and Markdown docs.
